# Root context is used by infra/nginx/Dockerfile — keep this tiny so `docker compose build`
# does not tar the whole monorepo (Flutter apps, multiple node_modules, etc.) and OOM small VPS.
#
# Only infra/nginx/** is copied by that Dockerfile.

.git
.github
.cursor
**/.dart_tool
**/build
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*

apps
backend
supabase
scripts
infra/deploy

*.md
*.iml
*.log
